WEBVTT

00:02:58.257 --> 00:03:00.092
including ethics questions,

00:03:00.134 --> 00:03:03.095
because the client's safety
is the priority.

00:03:03.471 --> 00:03:07.642
The sad truth is that only around
15 percent of applicants

00:03:07.642 --> 00:03:10.186
pass our selective assessment screening.

00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:12.063
After this assessment,

00:03:12.104 --> 00:03:16.317
it is important to match a client
with the right specialist.

00:03:16.359 --> 00:03:18.236
With our current matching algorithm,

00:03:18.236 --> 00:03:22.031
we've already helped
more than 35,000 people

00:03:22.073 --> 00:03:24.116
receive safe psychotherapy.

00:03:24.784 --> 00:03:27.536
We also offer pro-bono sessions

00:03:27.578 --> 00:03:29.372
and free educational materials

00:03:29.413 --> 00:03:32.208
to support those who can't afford therapy.